<title>AUSTRALIA: Australis porn pay TV channel to stay - govt.</title>
<headline>Australis porn pay TV channel to stay - govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian government has decided not to ban Australis Media Ltd's pay television pornography channel, Night Moves, a spokesman for Communications Minister Richard Alston said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Night Moves R-rated service will be continued,&quot; a spokesman for Alston told Reuters.</p>
<p>Alston had taken a proposal from conservative elements in the ruling Liberal/National coalition government to ban the channel to cabinet on Monday, but his proposal was rejected.</p>
</text>
